[01:29.38] I saw you, in a way
[01:33.45] Beyond figure out
[01:37.53] These lines of life
[01:41.32] Have been drawn and can't be removed
[01:46.18] Our eyes is all it took to know
[01:50.51] 
[01:54.78] Open up your eyes
[01:58.44] Deep blue, glassy lake
[02:03.07] And swim till water and sky
[02:06.65] Now are one, out of two
[02:11.44] Oh, my bloodshot eyes
[02:15.89] 
[02:19.91] Open up your mouth
[02:23.97] Touch your lips to mine
[02:27.91] That we may make a kiss
[02:31.58] That can pierce through death and survive
[02:36.24] Your words have branded my mind
[02:41.19] 
[03:22.48] Still I hold your hand
[03:26.51] Wrapped as if a ring
[03:30.74] We of flesh and blood
[03:34.42] Are only carrying
[03:38.52] It's so hard to... well, you know
[03:47.83] 
[03:51.26] The seed waits for the reaper to sow
[03:55.06] 
[03:59.76] Every breath an art
[04:03.46] The dignity to learn it
[04:07.51] Can strain and break your heart
[04:13.37] Take all your pieces home
[04:21.42] You ask when you're alone, "What is love?"
[04:33.70] The blood is love
[04:41.23] 